    "note": "Makoko on the lagoon as one frontage of about 24 metres (world:place-is-one-screen): a plank walk along the front of the houses on stilts, the room a character may rent on the left with its porch at the walk's height, the racks where fish is smoked, the classroom on stilts on the right, a spur back to the church, a second row behind and the Third Mainland Bridge far off beyond them. Canoes are moored at the walk; others carry goods and children along the channel on the shared clock. The lagoon's water moves under everything; the walk stands over its highest ripple.",
